<title>CHINA: Morgan Stanley sets conglomerate basket warrants.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets conglomerate basket warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd said on Thursday it launched one billion American style call warrants on a basket of conglomerate stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> CITIC Pacific Ltd			     0.01 shrs</p>
<p> Shum Yip Investment Ltd		     0.10 shrs</p>
<p> Hutchison Whampoa Ltd			 0.015 shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$2.5258     PREMIUM	  21.93 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.0716     GEARING	  3.7x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	14.AUG.97     MIN EXER LOT   100,000</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 15.JUN.98     LISTING	  HONG KONG</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT   HK$2.6587     PAYDATE	  01.SEPT.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW    HONG KONG     LISTING DATE   04.SEPT.97</p>
<p> NOTE		 PHYSICAL OR CASH SETTLEMENT AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>			DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
